-- 2005, dead on 10 June 2025 having made the will on 15 January that year.
`Danial Iskandar` MEANS
    `a person in the case file, in full` "Danial Iskandar" "danial" (JUST (YMD 2005 10 3))
        (`twenty-one years after` (YMD 2005 10 3)) (`died on` (YMD 2025 6 10))
        (LIST `a legitimate child in the case file` `Adam Iskandar`)
        TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE

