-- THE WILL. Unwitnessed and unacknowledged, so s 6(2) is not satisfied in any
-- particular; the only thing that carries it is s 27.
`the will of Danial Iskandar, written on operations` MEANS
    `a will, in full` `Danial Iskandar` (JUST (YMD 2025 1 15)) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
        EMPTY (LIST `a gift` `Adam Iskandar` `a residuary gift` 40_000 TRUE TRUE)
